**Evidence:** `db.collection('users').find(filter).toArray()` loads the entire matching result set into memory. With `filter` defaulting to `{}` (line 27), a request to `/users` with no filter retrieves every document in the collection. At scale, this causes memory exhaustion and potential application crash.

