| **Rule ID** | CYBER-002 |
| **Severity** | 🔴 **CRITICAL** |
| **Location** | Lines 29-31, Lines 34-36 |
| **CWE** | CWE-470: Use of Externally-Controlled Input to Select Classes/Methods |

**Description:**

The `Command` interface (line 34-36) is `Serializable` and declares an `execute()` method. Line 30-31 invokes `execute()` on any deserialized object that implements this interface:

```java
