var key = new byte[32]; // 256-bit for AES-256
RandomNumberGenerator.Fill(key);

// Or derive from a passphrase
using var kdf = new Rfc2898DeriveBytes(passphrase, salt, iterations: 600_000, HashAlgorithmName.SHA256);
var derivedKey = kdf.GetBytes(32);
```

